==Russian==

===Etymology===
From {{suf|ru|сөйлеу|-шник|lang1=kk|t1=speak!|alt1=сөйле}}, the word comes from the Kazakh phrase {{clip of|kk|қазақша сөйле|nocat=1|t=speak Kazakh!|notext=1}}, often used by native Kazakhs to encourage the use of Kazakhstan’s national language instead of Russian.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|со̂йле́шник}}
* {{ru-IPA|phon=суйле́шник}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|сойле́шник}}

# {{lb|ru|Kazakhstan|offensive}} [[Kazakh]] [[individual]], who calls to speak and learn the {{w|Kazakh language}}

====Declension====
{{ru-noun-table|сойле́шник}}

